# Credit Card Transaction & Fraud Dashboard (Excel)

## Overview
An Excel dashboard that analyzes credit card transaction amounts by merchant category, US state, merchant and time of day, with an is_fraud slicer to separate fraudulent from legitimate transactions.

## Dashboard
- Total transaction amount (all transactions): $23,045,584.75
- Top category: grocery_pos, 17.11% of total volume
- Top state: CA, $5.70M (25.83% of total)
- Peak window: late evening to midnight (10 PM - 12 AM)
- Charts: category-wise amount, state-wise amount, merchant-wise amount, date and time-wise amount

![Dashboard](finance%20data%20analysis%20dashboard.png)

## Report
A 10-page report combines the dashboard with industry context on fraud trends, region-level fraud rates in Europe, machine learning for fraud detection, AI-based prevention strategies, dark web threats and recommendations. Industry statistics in the report come from external sources (EBA-ECB, SEON and an ecommerce fraud benchmark article) and are not calculated from this dataset.

## Notes
- The dashboard shows amounts across all transactions unless the is_fraud slicer is filtered to 1.
- No machine learning model is built in this project.
